- **License**: MIT License
- **Author/Project**: Supertone Inc. / k2-fsa
- **Model**: `sherpa-onnx-supertonic-3-tts-int8` (`duration_predictor`, `text_encoder`, `vector_estimator`, `vocoder`, `voice.bin`)

